==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm}} {{term|riven||to rive|lang=enm}}, of {{etyl|gmq}} origin, from {{etyl|non}} {{term|rífa|rīfa|to rend, tear apart|lang=non}}, from {{proto|Germanic|rīfanan|to tear, scratch|lang=en}}, from {{proto|Germanic|(e)reip-|to crumble, tear|lang=en}}. Cognate with {{ofs}} {{term|riva|rīva|to tear|lang=ofs}}, {{ang}} {{term|aræfan|ārǣfan|to let loose, unwrap|lang=ang}}, {{non}} {{term|ript||breach of contract|tr=rift|lang=non}}. More at {{l|en|rift}}.

